<title>HONG KONG: Merrill Lynch sets put warrants on HSBC.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch sets put warrants on HSBC.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch International &amp; Co C.V. said it has launched 60 million American-style put warrants on shares of HSBC Holdings Plc.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    HK$161.50	    PREMIUM	   9.68 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     HK$1.47		GEARING	   11X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	1 YR AFTER LAUNCH  SETTLEMENT DAY  25.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   HONG KONG	    MIN EXER LOT    4,000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  HK$162.50	    GOVERNING LAW   HONG KONG</p>
<p> NOTES	     PHYSICAL SETTLEMENT ONLY</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
